0..69 Comment "// A session former written with no import of its home names no type."
70..72 Comment "//"
73..145 Comment "// `Run`, `Prefix` and `Dialogue` live in `std.session`, and the ambient"
146..222 Comment "// scope answers them nowhere. A source that names one lists it, as it lists"
223..250 Comment "// any other module\'s name."
251..253 Comment "//"
254..329 Comment "// The source writes each of the three without `import std.session (…);`,"
330..383 Comment "// and each type head is refused where it is written."
384..386 Comment "//"
387..402 Comment "// - see: #4521"
